in the songs of Morrisey

50
00:02:15,870 --> 00:02:18,138
and Bruce Springsteen,
the Turtles.

51
00:02:18,138 --> 00:02:20,175
- Yeah, I mean, if not for
the limitations of space,

52
00:02:20,175 --> 00:02:22,943
we ourselves might be riding
through the mansions of glory

53
00:02:22,943 --> 00:02:25,480
