70
00:03:04,718 --> 00:03:07,822
- Come in, Joel, my
little space guy,

71
00:03:07,822 --> 00:03:11,392
my little man who's
trapped up there,

72
00:03:11,392 --> 00:03:16,397
my little person who we
control in a funny kind of way.

73
00:03:17,532 --> 00:03:18,432
- Why don't you hit
the sack, Frank?

74
00:03:18,432 --> 00:03:20,368
I'll take over from here, okay?

75
00:03:20,368 --> 00:03:21,635
- Thanks, Dad.

76
00:03:22,937 --> 00:03:24,505
- Well, Joel, we're
gonna swing right into

77
00:03:24,505 --> 00:03:27,208
