106
00:04:37,845 --> 00:04:39,680
- What do you think, Joel?

107
00:04:39,680 --> 00:04:40,782
- I don't.

108
00:04:40,782 --> 00:04:42,317
- Whoa. Good one.
- Deep.

109
00:04:42,317 --> 00:04:43,150
Yeah.

110
00:04:43,150 --> 00:04:44,318
